// Base build settings for delts.
//
// The app does NOT embed any API key. All Gemini access is routed through the
// delts.fit server-side proxy (web/api/gemini.js), which holds GEMINI_API_KEY as
// a Vercel environment variable. This keeps secrets out of the shipped binary.
//
// If the proxy has no key configured yet, the app automatically falls back to
// offline workout generation.

// Coach chat lets you attach a photo from the camera or library.
INFOPLIST_KEY_NSCameraUsageDescription = DELTS uses the camera so you can attach a photo to the Coach chat.
INFOPLIST_KEY_NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription = DELTS lets you attach a photo from your library to the Coach chat.
